5,1,1,talk,Servas,,I believe we must first understand the human foundation of these projects. I shall examine the staffing rolls for technical posts and the minutes on secondments and crew strength.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to see where the money actually goes! I'll check the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers and the national computing agreement and facility day rates. This sounds like a fun puzzle!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think it would be wise to see what actually happened with past projects. I will look into the closeout files of finished awards and the portfolio review of schedule overruns.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm not interested in the money. I want to know why things actually stop working. I'll check the incident logs on shared instrumentation and the station records from partner field sites.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,I will focus on the shared infrastructure. I shall examine the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities and the national repository deposit turnaround.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It is a wise distribution of labor. By looking at both the people and the processes, we shall see the true shape of our capabilities. I look forward to hearing your discoveries.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Sakura,,Me too! I bet I'll find some super interesting secrets in those ledgers. Let's see who finds the weirdest thing!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
