13,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I hope my choices are helpful. I just want to make sure we don't make the same mistakes again.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
14,1,2,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
15,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"Stop worrying, Daisuke. Just find the facts. I'll find out where the real bottlenecks are, and we'll make sure this project actually finishes.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
