74,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'm glad we could decide this together. Thank you for listening to my concerns. I'll vote for Candidate A.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
